    Pages:
    - Id: landing
      ArtKey: 
      Title: A Lit Lantern
      Body: A lantern sways at the far end of the landing, though no hand holds it.
      Choices:
      - Text: Buy the lantern outright
        Requires:
        - Kind: 4
          CharacterId: 
          CharacterDisplayName: 
          Ability: 0
          Min: 99999
          HasMin: 1
          Max: 0
          HasMax: 0
          CounterId: 
          RequireStanding: 0
          AuthoredReason: Prince does not pay that well
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
      - Text: Ask the lantern its name
        Requires:
        - Kind: 1
          CharacterId: 
          CharacterDisplayName: 
          Ability: 0
          Min: 999
          HasMin: 1
          Max: 0
          HasMax: 0
          CounterId: 
          RequireStanding: 0
          AuthoredReason: 
        HiddenUntilMet: 1
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
      - Text: Follow the light
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires:
          - Kind: 0
            CharacterId: bear
            CharacterDisplayName: Bjorn
            Ability: 0
            Min: 0
            HasMin: 0
            Max: 0
            HasMax: 0
            CounterId: 
            RequireStanding: 0
            AuthoredReason: 
          Effects:
          - Kind: 0
            Amount: 5
            Item: 
            CounterId: 
            CharacterId: 
            CharacterDisplayName: 
            RelicId: 
            RelicDisplayName: 
            FightId: 
            ShelfId: 
            Reveal: 0
          Result: The lantern leads you down a stair of old stone. A few coins glint
            on the steps, and at the bottom someone large is already warming his
            paws at it.
          GoTo: bearer
          IsLeave: 0
        - Requires: []
          Effects:
          - Kind: 0
            Amount: 5
            Item: 
            CounterId: 
            CharacterId: 
            CharacterDisplayName: 
            RelicId: 
            RelicDisplayName: 
            FightId: 
            ShelfId: 
            Reveal: 0
          Result: The lantern leads you down a stair of old stone. A few coins glint
            on the steps.
          GoTo: quiet
          IsLeave: 0
      - Text: Leave
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Backgrounds/Dungeon.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: sheep
        Side: 0
      - CharacterId: owl
        Side: 1
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: A lantern sways at the far end of the landing, though no hand holds
          it. Its light is warm, and it is waiting for you.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 1
        Side: 0
        Text: Another reality, another landing. Prince says this one has <i>excellent</i>
          monsters. I believe him about half the time.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: happy
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 2
        Side: 0
        Text: The other half, he sends me in first. If that lantern starts talking,
          I am not the one answering it.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: annoyed
      - SpeakerId: owl
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: Hold still, both of you. That lantern burns from the far side of the
          wall, so somebody in the next reality lit it for us. Whoever they are,
          they are expecting company, and they are not a patient host.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: neutral
    - Id: bearer
      ArtKey: 
      Title: The Lantern Bearer
      Body: Bjorn is already at the bottom of the stair.
      Choices:
      - Text: Press on
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: farewell
          IsLeave: 0
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Backgrounds/Dungeon.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: bear
        Side: 0
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: bear
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 1
        Side: 0
        Text: Ha! I knew I smelled lamp oil. Took you long enough. Stand back, little
          ones, this light bites.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: happy
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: The lantern gutters once, as if it heard him.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
    - Id: quiet
      ArtKey: 
      Title: The Lantern Bearer
      Body: The stair is empty.
      Choices:
      - Text: Press on
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: farewell
          IsLeave: 0
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Backgrounds/Dungeon.png
      Cast: []
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: The stair is empty. Whoever lit the lantern has gone on ahead, and
          left the light for you.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
    - Id: farewell
      ArtKey: 
      Title: Out of the Dark
      Body: The lantern goes out.
      Choices:
      - Text: Leave
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: You leave with the lantern's warmth still in your paws. Prince
            will call it a detour. It was not.
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Backgrounds/Dungeon.png
      Cast: []
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: At the end of the stair the lantern goes out, as if it had done its
          job.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: Somewhere above, a door you never noticed closes softly.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
    BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Backgrounds/Dungeon.png
    MayReturn: 0
    Speakers: []
